one run step, \"Dispatch the tap autobump once PyPI serves this version\", which the mechanism-delta ratchet counts as a `ci_gate`. Its `# mechanism-ok:` marker must name a sunset ticket, and that ticket cannot close while the marker stands (src/rebar/_commands/sunset_markers.py `check_no_open_sunset_marker`). The step is permanent: it is how the release keeps the Homebrew formula current. This ticket is its standing admission, following the precedent of cankered-cloistered-bittern for `[verify] plan_review_engine`.\n\n## Approach\nThe marker at .github/workflows/release.yml (homebrew_tap job) names this ticket. Leave this ticket open while the step exists. If the step is ever removed, remove the marker in the same change and close this ticket as obsolete.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The homebrew_tap run step no longer exists in .github/workflows/release.yml and its marker is gone. Checked: `git grep -n \"mechanism-ok: ci_gate .github/workflows/release.yml::Dispatch the tap autobump\" origin/main` returns nothing.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":4,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"0344-6d97-3cc2-4c7b","ticket_type":"task","title":"Keep the release Homebrew tap dispatch admitted (permanent; stays open while the job exists)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["73f24e67-11c9-44ee-a10a-08242de983a8","20b269ef-c415-4c67-a190-ab7c5eb45cba"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795059350082697240,"uuid":"38cbacef-070e-435a-8582-1a3713a4ca61"}
